tests/qa-audit/.github/

# Credentials and team rosters — must never land in git.
# During the May 2026 DigiBull QA sprint, three artefacts ended up in
# the working tree as untracked files:
#   - team-credentials/trainer-qa_at_vivacareeracademy_com.txt
#   - scripts/team.csv (admin emails for Geeta, Suhani, Geetika, Sriniketh)
#   - apps/api/viva-academy-platform/ (a complete second clone of the repo
#     nested inside itself — a stray git clone destination)
# These have all been moved out of the working tree. The patterns below
# stop them — or anything shaped like them — from being staged in future.
team-credentials/
**/team-credentials/
*credentials*.txt
*credentials*.csv
scripts/team.csv
# Nested repo checkouts inside the repo (any path containing the project's
# own folder name)
apps/*/viva-academy-platform/
**/viva-academy-platform/viva-academy-platform/

# DigiBull QA tooling that briefly landed at the repo root in PR #3 —
# removed and preserved under ~/Desktop/KEEP - LIVE PROJECTS/digibull-handover-artifacts/
# These patterns prevent re-introduction if someone replays the same tooling.
/capture-qa.mjs
/create-qa-doc.mjs
/record-qa.mjs
/record-video.mjs
/test-logins.mjs
/docs/QA-FIXES-REPORT.docx
/docs/QA-FIXES-REPORT.md
